     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\">Hello!<br><br>I&#39;m trying to plot y = 2x + 0.2 from y=0 to 100. Firstly I make the data:<div><br></div><div><div style=\"border:1px solid rgb(187,187,187);word-wrap:break-word;background-color:rgb(250,250,250)\"><code><div><div>x_vec &lt;- 1:100</div><div>y_vec &lt;- seq(1,200,2)+0.2</div><div>data &lt;- data.frame(x=x_vec,y=y_vec) #y=2x + 0.2</div></div></code></div><br>Then I plot it using the following code:</div><div><br></div><div><div style=\"border:1px solid rgb(187,187,187);word-wrap:break-word;background-color:rgb(250,250,250)\"><code><div><div>ggplot(data, aes(x=x,y=y)) + </div><div>    geom_point(size=5,color=&#39;blue&#39;) + #plot points</div><div>    coord_cartesian(xlim = c(0,50), ylim = c(0, 100)) + #set limits for x &amp; y-axis</div><div>    scale_y_continuous(expand=c(0,0)) + #remove margins within the plot for y-axis  </div><div>    scale_x_continuous(expand=c(0,0)) + #remove margins within plot for x-axis</div><div>    theme_bw() + #make background white</div><div>    theme(panel.border = element_rect(colour = &quot;black&quot;, size=2)) + #make a thick, black border</div><div>    theme(axis.ticks.length=unit(-0.5, &quot;cm&quot;), axis.ticks.margin=unit(0.8, &quot;cm&quot;),axis.ticks.x=element_line(size=1),axis.ticks.y=element_line(size=1)) #make tick marks big and on the inside<br>    #Thickness of the border is more than the thickness of tick marks</div></div></code></div><br>And I get the following plot (red and green circles added by hand afterwards) :</div><div><a href=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/-6O4b9ApoUhA/VYGqXBHYTMI/AAAAAAAAAj8/PpDns0Ufw4s/s1600/Rplot.png\" style=\"clear:left;margin-bottom:1em;float:left;margin-right:1em\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/-6O4b9ApoUhA/VYGqXBHYTMI/AAAAAAAAAj8/PpDns0Ufw4s/s1600/Rplot.png&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792368996148000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1GAmkDjQb-sUZDxTsk8494\"><img src=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/-6O4b9ApoUhA/VYGqXBHYTMI/AAAAAAAAAj8/PpDns0Ufw4s/s320/Rplot.png\" border=\"0\" width=\"295\" height=\"320\"></a><br></div><div><br></div><div><br></div><p style=\"text-align:center;clear:both\"></p><div style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">So this is almost exactly what I want, just a couple of things that I would like to change which I don&#39;t know how to:</span></div><font color=\"#000000\"><div style=\"text-align:left\">1 - The last data point (red circle) is cut off by the border, which I guess is expected. But is there a way to make it sit on top of the border so that I can see the whole data point circle?</div></font><p></p><p style=\"text-align:left;clear:both\"><font color=\"#000000\">2 - The x-tick mark on the bottom and the y-tick mark on top are jutting out (green circles) to the left and on top respectively. (This is hard to notice on the plot above but if you zoom in you can see it clearly). Is there a way to make these tick marks be exactly in line with the border or make them go away?</font><br></p><p style=\"text-align:left;clear:both\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);text-align:center\"><br></span></p><p style=\"text-align:left;clear:both\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);text-align:center\">I have an example plot from MATLAB below (with the code) as an example of a plot with the 2 requirements above (again, red and green circles added by hand afterwards):</span><br></p><p style=\"text-align:left;clear:both\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);text-align:center\"><br></span></p><div style=\"border:1px solid rgb(187,187,187);word-wrap:break-word;background-color:rgb(250,250,250)\"><code><div><div>x=0:1:100; %create x vector<br>y=0:2:200 + 0.2; %create y vector = 2x + 0.2</div><div>plot(x,y,&#39;b.&#39;,&#39;MarkerSize&#39;,15) %Plot x vs. y with blue dots size 15</div><div>axis([0,50,0,100]) %set axis liimits to xlim(0,50) ylim(0,100)</div></div></code></div><p style=\"text-align:left;clear:both\"><font color=\"#000000\"><br></font></p><p style=\"text-align:center;clear:both\"></p><p style=\"text-align:left;clear:both\"><a href=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/-D-8Mvobe8cE/VYGq5wxBQpI/AAAAAAAAAkM/OyY8KJCHego/s1600/untitled.png\" style=\"text-align:center;clear:left;margin-bottom:1em;margin-right:1em;display:inline!important\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/-D-8Mvobe8cE/VYGq5wxBQpI/AAAAAAAAAkM/OyY8KJCHego/s1600/untitled.png&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792368996148000&amp;usg=AOvVaw173ZxmtOUaiFchlMFBIgqS\"><img src=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/-D-8Mvobe8cE/VYGq5wxBQpI/AAAAAAAAAkM/OyY8KJCHego/s400/untitled.png\" border=\"0\" width=\"400\" height=\"300\"></a><br></p><p style=\"text-align:left;clear:both\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">Thanks for your help :)</span><br></p><p style=\"text-align:center;clear:both\"><a href=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/-yxP7iSIonuM/VYGmyjueHFI/AAAAAAAAAjs/svyV6yoi5sw/s1600/Rplot.png\" style=\"clear:left;margin-bottom:1em;float:left;margin-right:1em\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/-yxP7iSIonuM/VYGmyjueHFI/AAAAAAAAAjs/svyV6yoi5sw/s1600/Rplot.png&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792368996148000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3SebZTLCcUCJttJP6SAD4Q\"><font color=\"#000000\"><br></font></a><a href=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/-yxP7iSIonuM/VYGmyjueHFI/AAAAAAAAAjs/svyV6yoi5sw/s1600/Rplot.png\" style=\"clear:left;margin-bottom:1em;float:left;margin-right:1em\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/-yxP7iSIonuM/VYGmyjueHFI/AAAAAAAAAjs/svyV6yoi5sw/s1600/Rplot.png&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792368996148000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3SebZTLCcUCJttJP6SAD4Q\"><font color=\"#000000\"><br></font></a><a href=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/-yxP7iSIonuM/VYGmyjueHFI/AAAAAAAAAjs/svyV6yoi5sw/s1600/Rplot.png\" style=\"clear:left;margin-bottom:1em;float:left;margin-right:1em\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/-yxP7iSIonuM/VYGmyjueHFI/AAAAAAAAAjs/svyV6yoi5sw/s1600/Rplot.png&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792368996148000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3SebZTLCcUCJttJP6SAD4Q\"><font color=\"#000000\"><br></font></a><font color=\"#000000\" style=\"clear:left;margin-bottom:1em;float:left;margin-right:1em;display:inline!important\"><a href=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/-yxP7iSIonuM/VYGmyjueHFI/AAAAAAAAAjs/svyV6yoi5sw/s1600/Rplot.png\" style=\"clear:left;margin-bottom:1em;float:left;margin-right:1em;display:inline!important\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/-yxP7iSIonuM/VYGmyjueHFI/AAAAAAAAAjs/svyV6yoi5sw/s1600/Rplot.png&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792368996148000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3SebZTLCcUCJttJP6SAD4Q\"> </a></font></p></div>"
